                  <td>Road networks established; early balloting of plot numbers in Sectors A, B, C, and D.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>2010 – 2013</strong><br/>Possession Handover &amp; Ring Road</td>
                  <td>Grant of initial construction possession in primary sectors; opening of Lahore Ring Road Southern Package.</td>
                  <td>First wave of luxury modern homes constructed; travel time to Lahore Airport slashed to under 10 minutes.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>2014 – 2018</strong><br/>Commercial Boom &amp; PKLI</td>
                  <td>CCA 1 and CCA 2 commercial plazas built; inauguration of Pakistan Kidney and Liver Institute (PKLI) in Sector N.</td>
                  <td>Rapid population inflow; corporate banks, supermarket chains (Jalal Sons), and premier schools opened branches.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>2019 – 2023</strong><br/>DHA Head Office &amp; Dolmen Mall</td>
                  <td>DHA Lahore Central Head Office operational in Sector A; construction and soft launch of Dolmen Mall Lahore.</td>
                  <td>Phase 6 established as the unequivocal administrative, commercial, and retail hub of suburban Lahore.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
