        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 4 -->
        <section id="location-overview" class="content-section">
          <h2>4. Location Overview &amp; Connectivity</h2>
          <p>
            Geographically, DHA Phase 6 occupies one of the most strategically connected footprints in the Lahore metropolitan area. 
            Situated between latitudes 31.4600° N and 31.4925° N, and longitudes 74.4370° E and 74.4840° E, the phase functions as the central transit bridge 
            connecting established central Lahore with emerging suburban phases (Phase 7, 8, and 9 Prism).
          </p>
          <div class="connectivity-grid">
            <div class="connect-card">
              <h4>Lahore Ring Road (L-20)</h4>
              <p>Direct connectivity via Nawaz Sharif Interchange and Barki Road Interchange. Connects Phase 6 residents to Gulberg in 15 minutes, Lahore Cantt in 12 minutes, and Motorway (M-2 / M-3) in 25 minutes.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="connect-card">
              <h4>Allama Iqbal International Airport</h4>
              <p>Located just 8 to 12 minutes drive north along Ring Road or via Phase 8 boulevards, making Phase 6 the most convenient residential address for frequent flyers and overseas Pakistanis.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="connect-card">
              <h4>Bedian Road Corridor</h4>
              <p>Flanks the western perimeter of Phase 6 (Sectors A, C, E, G), providing immediate access to elite sports clubs, farmhouse enclaves, and direct transit toward Cantt and Bhatta Chowk.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="connect-card">
              <h4>Barki Road Arterial</h4>
              <p>Borders the eastern edge of Phase 6 (Sectors M, N, J), facilitating smooth travel toward Paragon City, BRB Canal recreation zones, and the educational belt.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>
            Internally, Phase 6 features a dual-spine boulevard system: the primary <strong>Main Boulevard</strong> runs east-west from Bedian Road through to Phase 7 and Barki Road, 
            while perpendicular 100-foot avenues (such as Shabbir Sharif Road) intersect seamlessly, ensuring that bumper-to-bumper traffic jams are virtually non-existent.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 5 -->
        <section id="master-plan" class="content-section">
          <h2>5. Master Plan Explanation</h2>
          <p>
            The master plan of DHA Phase 6 is widely celebrated as the apex of suburban civil engineering in Punjab. 
            Unlike unstructured municipal layouts characterized by blind corners and narrow dead-ends, Phase 6 was laid out using hierarchical road geometry:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Primary Express Boulevards (150 ft):</strong> Designed with multi-lane carriage tracks, service lanes, and expansive landscaped center medians accommodating automated LED street lighting and underground storm water drains.</li>
            <li><strong>Sector Collector Roads (80 ft – 100 ft):</strong> Interconnect individual sectors without routing heavy transit traffic through residential interior streets.</li>
            <li><strong>Residential Access Streets (40 ft – 50 ft):</strong> Broad, paved streets ensuring easy two-way vehicle passing, curbside parking, and designated tree-planting easements.</li>
            <li><strong>Underground Utility Envelopes:</strong> 100% of high-voltage electrical cabling, fiber-optic telecommunications (PTCL, StormFiber, Nayatel, Optix), natural gas pipelines (SNGPL), and pressurized clean water distribution lines are buried underground, preserving clean sightlines.</li>
            <li><strong>Storm Water &amp; Drainage Systems:</strong> Dedicated underground rainwater drainage channels gravity-feed into municipal stormwater reservoirs, preventing urban flooding even during peak monsoon cloudbursts.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            For a high-resolution interactive map and downloadable sector blueprints, explore our dedicated <a href="/dha-phase-6-lahore-map/">DHA Phase 6 Lahore Master Plan Map Guide</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 6 -->
        <section id="sector-overview" class="content-section">
          <h2>6. Sector-by-Sector Overview</h2>
          <p>
            DHA Phase 6 is partitioned into 13 residential sectors (labeled A through N, with the omission of Sector I per military naming tradition) 
            and 4 specialized commercial enclaves. Each sector possesses a distinct urban identity, price point, and community atmosphere:
          </p>

          <div class="sectors-table-wrapper">
            <table class="data-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>Sector</th>
                  <th>Primary Plot Sizes</th>
                  <th>Character &amp; Signature Landmarks</th>
                  <th>Detailed Guide</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {SECTORS_DIRECTORY.map((s) => (
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>{s.label}</strong></td>
                    <td>{s.type === 'commercial' ? '4, 8 Marla & Commercial Plazas' : '10 Marla, 1 Kanal, 2 Kanal'}</td>
                    <td>{s.description}</td>
                    <td>
                      <a href={`/dha-phase-6-${s.key}-lahore/`} class="table-link">Read Guide &rarr;</a>
                      <br/>
                      <a href={`/entities/dha-phase-6-${s.key}/`} class="table-sublink">Entity Profile</a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                ))}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <p>
            Whether you prioritize quiet cul-de-sacs with low vehicular traffic (such as Sectors F, K, and L) or seek instant walking proximity to commercial centers and schools (such as Sectors C, D, and H), 
            the sector-by-sector granularity of Phase 6 accommodates every lifestyle preference.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 7 -->
        <section id="residential-areas" class="content-section">
          <h2>7. Residential Areas &amp; Plot Sizes</h2>
          <p>
            The residential fabric of DHA Phase 6 is dominated by spacious <strong>1 Kanal (approx. 4,500 sq ft / 500 sq yds)</strong> plots, 
            which comprise over 75% of the total residential inventory. This prevalence sets the prestigious suburban tone of the community: 
            broad frontages, elegant double-story private villas, private front lawns, and two-car garage footprints.
          </p>
          <div class="plot-distribution-grid">
            <div class="plot-card">
              <h3>5 Marla Residential</h3>
              <p class="plot-meta">Dimensions: 25' &times; 45' &bull; Approx. 1,125 sq ft</p>
              <p>
                Rare and highly coveted pocket offerings located near perimeter belts and designated community blocks. 
                Ideal for young executive couples, downsizing retirees, or buy-to-let investors seeking high rental yields relative to capital outlay.
              </p>
              <a href="/5-marla-house-for-sale-dha-phase-6-lahore/" class="plot-btn">Browse 5 Marla Houses &rarr;</a>
            </div>
            <div class="plot-card">
              <h3>10 Marla Residential</h3>
              <p class="plot-meta">Dimensions: 35' &times; 65' &bull; Approx. 2,250 sq ft</p>
              <p>
                Heavily concentrated in prime central sectors like Sector C and Sector D. These plots offer the sweet spot between manageable construction budgets, 
                luxurious 4-bedroom living layouts, and exceptional liquidity in secondary market trading.
              </p>
              <a href="/10-marla-house-for-sale-dha-phase-6-lahore/" class="plot-btn">Browse 10 Marla Houses &rarr;</a>
            </div>
            <div class="plot-card">
              <h3>1 Kanal Residential</h3>
              <p class="plot-meta">Dimensions: 50' &times; 90' &bull; Approx. 4,500 sq ft</p>
              <p>
                The hallmark signature of DHA Phase 6 living. Available across Sectors A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, J, K, L, M, and N. 
                Allows expansive 5-bedroom layouts, double-height lobbies, servant quarters, basement home theaters, and swimming pools.
              </p>
              <a href="/1-kanal-house-for-sale-dha-phase-6-lahore/" class="plot-btn">Browse 1 Kanal Houses &rarr;</a>
            </div>
            <div class="plot-card">
              <h3>2 Kanal Residential</h3>
              <p class="plot-meta">Dimensions: 75' &times; 120' &bull; Approx. 9,000 sq ft</p>
