            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 8 -->
        <section id="commercial-areas" class="content-section">
          <h2>8. Commercial Hubs &amp; CCA Enclaves</h2>
          <p>
            DHA Phase 6 revolutionized commercial real estate in Lahore by moving away from cramped roadside bazaars into planned commercial plazas with designated basement parking, 
            wide pedestrian walkways, and distinct zoning for corporate offices, retail showrooms, banks, and culinary destinations.
          </p>
          <div class="commercial-clusters-grid">
            <div class="comm-block">
              <h3><a href="/cca-1-dha-phase-6-lahore/">CCA 1 (Central Commercial Area 1)</a></h3>
              <p>
                The financial and daily convenience epicenter of Phase 6. Anchored by Jalal Sons, major supermarket chains, medical pharmacies (Servaid, Fazal Din), 
                and Pakistan's largest concentration of commercial banking branches (Meezan Bank, Habib Bank Limited, Standard Chartered, Bank Alfalah). 
